      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Where each array index of dcismDict\nrepresents a PROGRAM and inside each\nindex contains an array of pointers \ncalled studDict to a struct studNode, \nwhere each array index of studDict \nrepresents the students of each\nyearLevel. ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Where each array index of dcismDict\nrepresents a PROGRAM and inside each\nindex contains an array of pointers \ncalled studDict to a struct studNode, \nwhere each array index of studDict \nrepresents the students of each\nyearLevel. ",
